## ?? How to Complete the APK Build

### Option A: Downgrade Java to 21 (Recommended)

1. Download Java 21 LTS from:
   https://www.oracle.com/java/technologies/javase/jdk21-archive-downloads.html
   OR
   https://adoptium.net/temurin/releases/?version=21

2. Install Java 21

3. Set JAVA_HOME to Java 21:
   ```bash
   $env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-21"
   ```

4. Run build:
   ```bash
   npx cap build android
   ```

### Option B: Use Android Studio

1. Open Android project:
   ```bash
   npx cap open android
   ```

2. Android Studio will open

3. Click: **Build** ? **Build Bundle(s) / APK(s)** ? **Build APKs**

4. Wait for build to complete

5. APK will be in: `android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`

### Option C: Use Gradle Directly (if Java 21 installed)

```bash
$env:JAVA_HOME="C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-21"
cd android
./gradlew.bat assembleDebug
cd ..
```

